{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And he shall give to the priest the sacred thing.</b> Its meaning is with the sacred thing, or the word ונתן לכהן ('and he shall give to the priest') draws itself and another with it, and so its interpretation is: and he shall add its fifth to it, and he shall give to the priest — and he shall give the sacred thing. In my opinion there is no need for the word עליו ('to it')."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:43.432123200Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}